// Two licks over an E7 thumb (open E and open D alternating: no fretted bass, so the fretting
// hand is free). Bar 1: E D B D, G hammered to G# (b3 to 3), B. Bar 2: Bb slid to B (b5 to 5),
// B D E D G. Blue notes: G (b3), Bb (b5) and D (b7).
\title "Blues licks over a steady thumb in E"
\tempo 90
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
\staff { tabs }
\ts (4 4)
:8 (0.6 0.1) 3.2{lf 4} (0.4 0.2) 3.2 (0.6 0.3{h}) 1.3{lf 2} :4 (0.4 0.2) |
:8 (0.6 3.3{lf 4 sl}) 4.3{lf 4} (0.4 0.2) 3.2{lf 3} (0.6 0.1) 3.2 :4 (0.4 0.3)
